{\plain {The carrier signal used to transmit
 each binary number is shifted in phase 
depending on whether a logic 1 or 0 is being
 sent.\par \par                         
           s(t) =  Ac*cos(}{\f1 w}{c*t) 
         for logic 1\par                
                    }{s(t) = -Ac*cos(}{\f1 
w}{c*t)          for logic 0}{  \par \par 
Here, we set Ac=1 and determine the coefficient,
 either +1 or -1, for the carrier signal
 cos(}{\f1 w}{c*t).}}
}
.EQN 16 16 35 0
({0:coeff}NAME)[({0:n}NAME):{0:if}NAME(({0:Seq}NAME)[({0:n}NAME),1,-1)
