{\plain {Notice that for logic 1, the values
 of the mixed signal are all positive.  
And, those for logic 0 are all negative.}}
}
.TXT 8 0 133 0
Cg a73.100000,73.000000,382
{\rtf1\ansi \deff0
{\fonttbl
{\f0\fnil Arial;}
{\f1\fnil Symbol;}
}
{\plain {Next, we low pass filter the mixed
 signal to obtain an estimate of the carrier
 signal coefficient.  We then run the coefficients
 through a comparitor.  }{The result is 
that if our estimated value is positive 
then we recieved a logic 1 signal.  If it
 is negative we have recieved a logic 0.
  By filtering all the demodulated signals
 we can obtain our original digital sequence.}}
}
