{\plain {By testing different values for
 }{\f1 w}{\f1 e}{ and }{\f1 q}{LO we found
 that:\par \par 1)  For a small and large
 }{\f1 w}{\f1 e,}{ }{the estimate for the
 coeffecient is clo}{se to 0 when it should
 be distinctly            close to -1.  
}{This could cause an error in the estimate
 for the transmitted digital bit.}{\par 
2)  For small and large phase shift error
 }{\f1 q}{LO, the }{estimate for the coeffecient
